DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/pages/projects/{project_name}/deployments/{deployment_id}/tails/{tail_id}
Deletes a tail from a Pages deployment.
Required: tail_id (path); deployment_id (path); project_name (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/pages/projects/{project_name}/deployments/{deployment_id}
Fetch information about a deployment.
Required: deployment_id (path); project_name (path); account_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/pages/projects/{project_name}/domains/{domain_name}
Delete a Pages project's domain.
Required: domain_name (path); project_name (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/pages/projects/{project_name}/domains/{domain_name}
Fetch a single domain.
Required: domain_name (path); project_name (path); account_id (path)

PATCH /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/pages/projects/{project_name}/domains/{domain_name}
Retry the validation status of a single domain.
Required: domain_name (path); project_name (path); account_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/pages/projects/{project_name}
Delete a project by name.
Required: project_name (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/pages/projects/{project_name}
Fetch a project by name.
Required: project_name (path); account_id (path)

PATCH /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/pages/projects/{project_name}
Set new attributes for an existing project. Modify environment variables. To delete an environment variable, set the key to null.
Required: project_name (path); account_id (path); body (body)
